<title>POLAND: STALEXPORT FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 3.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALEXPORT FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 3.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.66 vs   5.77</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.93 vs   9.82</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.42 vs   8.43</p>
<p> Sales		  199.33 vs 132.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.04 vs   8.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.74 vs  14.87</p>
<p> Operating profit    14.60 vs  13.13</p>
<p> Sales		  375.49 vs 259.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Stalexport SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
